OL,5,G0015 Millionaire Hot Seat
OL,6,     FJeremy Clarkson hosts the quiz
OL,7,     Fwhere each episode sees six
OL,8,     Fhopefuls compete for the #1
OL,9,     Fmillion prize - however, only one
OL,10,     Fplayer can take their place in the
OL,11,     FHot Seat at a time and answer
OL,12,     Fmultiple-choice questions to work
OL,13,     Ftheir way up the Money Ladder.
OL,14,     FUnlike classic Millionaire, each
OL,15,     Fquestion is against the clock and
OL,16,     Fthere is no room for indecision -
OL,17,     Fonly one player will have a chance
OL,18,     Fto win the top prize remaining on
OL,19,     Fthe ladder, but will they be able
OL,20,     Fto do so?
